      "level": "Advanced",
      "hint": "Disables memory prefetching. Negligible on NVMe with 32 GB RAM; may slow app launches slightly. Measure before/after.",
      "description": "Sets the SysMain service to Disabled and stops it. SysMain preloads frequently used programs into memory; on a fast NVMe SSD with plenty of RAM its benefit and its cost are both small. Honest expectation: no FPS change. Measure load times before/after if you try it.",
